    <data key="d0">OutSystems Monolith Data Decomposition</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kWxymroGeE</data>
    <data key="d2">OutSystems decomposes its data monolith by classifying data types (binary, relational, key-value, encrypted) and storing them in specialized AWS services (S3, Aurora Serverless, DynamoDB, Secrets Manager) secured via KMS tenant keys.</data>
    <data key="d3">data_ingestion, compute_intensive</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
